`s 1033(5)(b) the change of name may be made by resolution of the directors` MEANS
    IF `the company is restored to the register as if its registered number was also its name`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If the company is restored to the register as if its registered number was also its name"; the company was not so restored

